Bundled fonts — SIL Open Font License 1.1
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following font files are redistributed in fonts/ under the SIL Open Font
License, Version 1.1. The full license text is in fonts/OFL.txt.

  fonts/Amiri-Regular.ttf    Amiri
  fonts/Amiri-Bold.ttf       Amiri
  fonts/KawkabMono-Regular.ttf  Kawkab Mono (copyright notice and licence
                                in fonts/OFL-KawkabMono.txt)

Amiri is bundled so that connected Arabic renders correctly from a fresh
clone, with no font installation step. Kawkab Mono is bundled so every
user has a monospaced Arabic font to pick in Settings → Arabic font, even
on a PC that has none installed. It is redistributed unmodified.
